sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor G as Guest
  participant B as Bot (n8n Brain)
  participant DB as MySQL
  actor R as Receptionist
  G->>B: "hi"
  B-->>G: Welcome menu (book / rates / status / cancel / receptionist)
  G->>B: "i want to book 2 AC rooms, 5 to 7 Nov"
  B->>DB: availability + exact total
  DB-->>B: free rooms, total Rs 12,000
  B-->>G: Rooms available, total Rs 12,000. How many guests?
  G->>B: guests, name, ID type + number
  B->>B: validate ID (format + Aadhaar checksum)
  B-->>G: Summary (ID masked). Reply YES to send the request
  G->>B: "Yes"
  B->>DB: hb_create_booking (one transaction:<br/>lock rooms, re-check, guest, header, room lines)
  B-->>G: Request received, NOT confirmed yet
  loop every 20 seconds
    B->>DB: new PENDING requests?
  end
  B->>R: Alert + approval link
  R->>B: opens link, sees full details
  R->>B: Approve (or Reject + reason)
  B->>DB: status = CONFIRMED / REJECTED
  B-->>G: Booking CONFIRMED (or rejected + reason)
  Note over B,DB: guest_notified flag set only after the send succeeds,<br/>a sweeper retries failed notifications
  Note over B,DB: No answer in 30 min: request EXPIRES and rooms are released
